Key Respon', 10, null, 'cmo7cm0tz00007vnc8nh5kbpc', 'cmodwcn1l0001r40k9i3fdrpg', 'Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)', 'The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.
________________________________________
Key Responsibilities
•	Business Development: Proactively identify and convert new business opportunities within the corporate sector and large-scale facility management firms.
•	Contract Management: Secure and manage Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC) and long-term rate contracts to ensure steady service revenue.
•	Relationship Management: Serve as the primary point of contact for corporate clients, fostering long-term partnerships and ensuring high levels of client satisfaction.
•	Sales Coordination: Act as the vital link between clients, authorized dealers, and internal technical teams to ensure 100% compliance with service deadlines.
•	Negotiation & Closing: Lead commercial discussions, handle complex negotiations, and successfully close service-oriented deals.
•	Market Intelligence: Monitor industry trends and competitor activity to provide actionable feedback for service improvement and market positioning.
•	Reporting: Maintain accurate sales pipelines and provide regular reports on business development activities and service delivery status.', '["•\\tNegotiation","•\\tCommunication","•\\tStrategic Planning","•\\tContract Management","B2B Business Development"]', null, null, 0, true, null, null, null, '2026-04-25 05:35:50.295', '2026-04-25 06:35:37.593', null), ('cmodyxpo2000jr40k16183rca', 'CMP-NYZEKL', 'COMPANY', 'READY', null, null, null, 'Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)', 'The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.
