Build responsive, high-performance single-page applications (SPAs) using Angular (v12+), TypeScript, RxJS, and NgRx/Store.
Develop and consume RESTful APIs and GraphQL services.
Implement and optimize database interactions with PostgreSQL / MySQL / Oracle (SQL & NoSQL experience is a plus).
Write clean, maintainable, and testable code following best practices (SOLID, Clean Code, TDD/BDD).
Integrate frontend applications with backend services and third-party systems.
Participate in code reviews, architecture discussions, and agile ceremonies (Scrum/Kanban).
Ensure application security, performance, scalability, and observability.
Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve production issues efficiently.
Collaborate closely with UI/UX designers, product owners, QA engineers, and DevOps teams.

Required Skills & QualificationsBachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent experience.
4+ years of hands-on experience in Java development.
3+ years of strong experience with Angular (latest versions), including:Components, Modules, Services, Routing
Reactive Forms & Template-Driven Forms
RxJS & State Management (NgRx or Signals)
Angular CLI, Lazy Loading, SSR (optional)

Strong proficiency in Spring Boot, Spring Security, Spring Data JPA, Hibernate.
Solid understanding of REST APIs, Microservices architecture, and API documentation (Swagger/OpenAPI).
Experience with SQL databases and basic knowledge of NoSQL (MongoDB, Redis).
Good knowledge of version control (Git), CI/CD pipelines, and containerization (Docker, Kubernetes is a plus).
Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS / Azure / GCP).
Strong problem-solving, analytical, and communication skills.
Ability to work independently and as part of a collaborative team.', '["Java","Angular"]', null, null, 0, true, null, '2026-05-07 20:04:54.326', '2026-05-07 20:15:01.76', '2026-05-07 20:03:11.054', '2026-05-07 20:15:01.763', null), ('cmowa44xw008in20k88abcm5n', 'CMP-GX3J5E', 'COMPANY', 'COMPLETED', 'nikhil', 'nikhiljava8686@gmail.com', 'cmowa44dm008gn20k9axn0or5', 'Java Developer', 'We are looking for a passionate Full Stack Java Developer with strong Angular expertise to join our dynamic engineering team. You will design, develop, and maintain scalable web applications, working on both backend services and modern frontend interfaces. This is a hands-on role where you will contribute across the entire technology stack, from database design to user-facing features.Key Responsi', 10, null, 'cmo8npyub001huj0kf9bborgt', 'cmovvkvs1007mn20kp0o7h93s', 'Java Developer', 'We are looking for a passionate Full Stack Java Developer with strong Angular expertise to join our dynamic engineering team. You will design, develop, and maintain scalable web applications, working on both backend services and modern frontend interfaces. This is a hands-on role where you will contribute across the entire technology stack, from database design to user-facing features.Key ResponsibilitiesDesign, develop, and maintain robust backend applications using Java, Spring Boot, and related frameworks.
